  "description": "MongoDB implementation of the GDPR compliance store for the Excalibur framework. Provides durable consent records, erasure logs, and subject-access request tracking on MongoDB. Install this package only if you store compliance records in MongoDB: it is the only package that brings MongoDB.Driver into a consumer's graph. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
